               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Uses
  <br/>
 For the temporary relief of localdiscomfort, itching, and pain in theperianal area associated with
  <br/>
hemorrhoids and other anorectal
  <br/>
disorders
 </paragraph>
