               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>DirectionsAdults: When practical, cleansethe affected area with mild soap
  <br/>
and warm water and rinsethoroughly. Gently dry by pattingor blotting with toilet tissue or asoft cloth before application of this
  <br/>
product.
  <br/>
 Apply externally to the affectedarea up to 6 times daily
  <br/>
Children under 12 years of age:
  <br/>
consult a doctor
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260320"/>
            </section>
